 The AI Planner provides a powerful web interface to turn natural-language developer requests into structured, executable code plans. It also features a dedicated LLM Prompt Generator to assist in creating highly constrained system prompts for custom AI tasks, alongside **integrated file management**, a **dedicated code workspace (Codejector)**, and an **integrated shell terminal** for reviewing and modifying files locally and running commands. Built with TypeScript, a React + Vite frontend, and a Node/NestJS backend, it streamlines the process of generating, reviewing, and applying code changes safely.
 
 - Repository: evillan0315/ai-planner
 - Primary language: TypeScript
 
